Concluding Summary
"The clinic utilizes the SOSTAC® model to systematically plan its marketing activities. By starting with a thorough situational analysis and setting measurable goals, the clinic implements a trust-based strategy. This ensures that marketing tactics remain sensitive to the psychological nature of the field while maintaining rigorous performance monitoring to ensure sustainable growth and high-quality care."
